  "_source": "Material classes for the lit shading modes (ww_material.gdshader). A class sets the physical defaults (metallic, roughness, specular, sheen, clearcoat, backlight). Classification order: (1) `curated` - exact (archive, material) pairs, the ONLY way a material becomes metal, because 19.3% of the game's 8,946 materials carry Maya default names and only 87 match a metal keyword (docs/pbr_assessment.md section 4); (2) `by_archive` - whole archives from ww_actors.py; (3) `by_name` - substrings of the material or texture name, romaji and English; (4) `default` = dielectric and rough, the safe direction to be wrong in. Nothing in here was eyeballed on screen yet - see `honesty`.",
